      "refersTo": "nav-link",
      "description": "Destino activo sobre un fragmento de vidrio.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Navegación\"><a class=\"ds-link ds-active\" href=\"#resumen\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"19\" height=\"19\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"m14.31 8 5.74 9.94M9.69 8h11.48M7.38 12l5.74-9.94M9.69 16 3.95 6.06M14.31 16H2.83m13.79-4-5.74 9.94\"/></svg>Resumen</a></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{padding:14px;background:var(--glass);border-radius:18px;backdrop-filter:blur(22px) saturate(125%);box-shadow:var(--shadow),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(218,238,255,.1),inset 1px 0 0 rgba(218,238,255,.04)}.ds-link{display:flex;position:relative;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:14px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted);font:13px \"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;min-height:47px;text-decoration:none}.ds-link:hover{color:var(--text);background:var(--hover)}.ds-link:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:4px}.ds-active{color:var(--accent);background:linear-gradient(105deg,rgba(107,186,212,.14),rgba(107,186,212,.04));box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(179,227,244,.13)}.ds-active::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:3px;height:16px;right:12px;top:calc(50% - 8px);border-radius:4px;background:var(--accent)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Etiqueta de categoría",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "category-tag",
      "description": "Metadato compacto, no interactivo.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-category\">Software</span>",
      "css": ".ds-category{padding:5px 8px;background:var(--raised);border-radius:5px;font:10px \"IBM Plex Sans\",sans-serif;color:var(--muted)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition-duration:.01ms!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tarjeta de proyecto",
      "kind": "card",
